    "created_at": "2017-05-10T18:43:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-10T18:43:21Z",
    "body": "Given that this makes no normative difference and makes it harder for other specs to extend, I'll close this. It's better to allow each spec to define the arguments it accepts than to try to constrain them using IDL.",
